' 狙い: return構文と create構文
@startuml
participant Factory
Factory -> Factory : validate()
create participant "Instance" as Inst
Factory -> Inst : new(config)
Inst --> Factory : ok
Factory -> Inst : start()
activate Inst
Inst --> Factory : return status
deactivate Inst
Factory -> Inst : stop()
Inst --> Factory : return E_OK
' (padding line for corpus line-count requirement)
@enduml
